 so conservative scores high) is also computed + reported at zero weight until validated — see coverage.accrualsPct. Live weights are REGIME-ADAPTIVE (mom12m cut hard in Risk-off — it crashes in volatile bears); regime.adaptiveVsFixed shows the honest comparison. Backtest longs the top decile ~quarterly vs equal-weight universe. Causal; survivorship-biased; annual fundamentals + 60-day lag; simplified costs. IC = rank corr of score vs 63-day forward return. Not a forecast."}